    "text": "Correct order of basic strength of Pyrrole <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/3OGMhjroZZ2CGAXMPenr84qOfDgEWbWAdvWuBc1TvjI.original.fullsize.png\"><br>, Pyridine<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/QDkeSuYeVBcViVG1sFChkH0h94ihnUSaV-RtShoftGI.original.fullsize.png\"><br>, and Piperidine<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/PuW1EJRzd6m5qyIvRL3tdwrZ7yxFLwKnrNQiTyAK0_4.original.fullsize.png\"><br> is:",
